1
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:39,600
[EP22]

2
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:52,500
Bring it here.

3
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,340
I know what's on it.

4
00:01:10,140 --> 00:01:11,800
She chose to publish it at this time,

5
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:14,540
during the rotation of guards.

6
00:01:15,740 --> 00:01:16,480
Very clever.

7
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,060
The journalists in Yang City should be rewarded.

8
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:22,960
Young Madam must have her reasons.

9
00:01:23,180 --> 00:01:24,720
She must have been coerced by Chu Nanfeng.

10
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:27,080
She doesn't really want to divorce you.

11
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:29,580
That's good.

12
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:31,660
Deputy Li,

13
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:34,780
how long have you been with me?

14
00:01:35,740 --> 00:01:36,420
Young Marshal,

15
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,780
7 years and 4 months.

16
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:41,820
Young Madam

17
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,340
is definitely not willing to do this.

18
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:45,740
I'm willing to lead the troops

19
00:01:45,740 --> 00:01:46,920
to rescue her at night.

20
00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:48,860
7 years and 4 months.

21
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:51,860
Do you remember

22
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:54,860
the tree my mother planted when she was a child?

23
00:01:55,540 --> 00:01:56,500
Yes.

24
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:59,440
There are many gold bars

25
00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:01,020
under the third brick beside the tree root.

26
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:02,800
Take them all.

27
00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:04,020
Take your whole family

28
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:05,240
and leave Yang City to live a good life.

29
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,060
It's enough for you to live a lifetime.

30
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,700
The plague is rampant in the city.

31
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:10,400
Although our troops are damaged,

32
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,680
we are not powerless to fight

33
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:13,160
compared with Chu Nanfeng.

34
00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:14,920
Young Marshal, you can't give up.

35
00:02:15,380 --> 00:02:16,360
After the war,

36
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,360
the whole city will be damaged.

37
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,980
The people of Yang City will suffer.

38
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:21,860
Chu Nanfeng

39
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,420
just wants my power

40
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:24,200
and my life.

41
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,460
I'll give it to him.

42
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:28,760
I just hope the people of Yang City are safe.

43
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:30,060
Young Marshal,

44
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:32,340
you can't joke about your life.

45
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,080
What I want is for the people of Yang City

46
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:37,580
to live well.

47
00:02:38,940 --> 00:02:39,300
You can go.

48
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:43,940
Get out.

49
00:02:52,860 --> 00:02:54,080
You've been listening for so long.

50
00:02:54,540 --> 00:02:55,080
Come down.

51
00:03:05,420 --> 00:03:07,380
The show has just begun.

52
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,520
How could it be?

53
00:03:10,380 --> 00:03:12,380
But at this time,

54
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,180
Young Marshal Ling

55
00:03:14,180 --> 00:03:15,520
still believe

56
00:03:16,660 --> 00:03:17,920
in so-called love.

57
00:03:21,780 --> 00:03:23,480
You're so naive.

58
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:25,560
But...

59
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:26,240
Love...

60
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:31,880
I didn't expect

61
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:34,480
you to hide it so well.

62
00:03:35,140 --> 00:03:36,840
You've got everyone fooled.

63
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,520
What's wrong with me?

64
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,680
I just want

65
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,640
to get everything I want.

66
00:03:46,780 --> 00:03:48,380
and make my son

67
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:50,860
inherit everything of Ling family?

68
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:52,480
Am I wrong?

69
00:03:54,060 --> 00:03:54,820
And you

70
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,880
got in my way,

71
00:03:57,660 --> 00:03:59,420
got in my son's way.

72
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:01,620
You deserve to die.

73
00:04:02,580 --> 00:04:04,080
You can take my life,

74
00:04:04,380 --> 00:04:06,160
but Su Muwan is innocent.

75
00:04:07,060 --> 00:04:07,920
Please let her go.

76
00:04:14,860 --> 00:04:15,980
Beg me?

77
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,060
Fine.

78
00:04:21,960 --> 00:04:22,660
On your knees.

79
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:25,960
Beg me.

80
00:04:28,780 --> 00:04:30,680
Aren't you always above others?

81
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:32,320
Aren't you

82
00:04:32,320 --> 00:04:33,860
the Young Marshal Ling?

83
00:04:34,860 --> 00:04:35,880
On your knees.

84
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:37,600
Beg me.

85
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:41,680
Maybe

86
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:44,240
I'll consider

87
00:04:47,780 --> 00:04:48,980
to let her go.

88
00:04:55,860 --> 00:04:57,040
Beg me.

89
00:05:19,300 --> 00:05:20,220
Please.

90
00:05:24,180 --> 00:05:25,380
Let her go.

91
00:05:33,460 --> 00:05:35,060
What a beautiful love story.

92
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:37,720
It's really

93
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:39,480
a rare

94
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,940
sunset scene.

95
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,460
It's just a pity.

96
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:47,560
Su Muwan

97
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,280
saw

98
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,820
what she shouldn't have seen.

99
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,020
She

100
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:57,140
must

101
00:05:57,860 --> 00:05:58,480
die.

102
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:00,340
Die!

103
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:06,920
Kill me!

104
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:11,000
Kill me,

105
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,200
and Su Muwan

106
00:06:13,700 --> 00:06:14,260
will

107
00:06:14,260 --> 00:06:15,960
die immediately.

108
00:06:18,300 --> 00:06:20,080
The people of Yang City

109
00:06:22,100 --> 00:06:23,460
will also die.

110
00:07:12,500 --> 00:07:13,500
What about Su Muwan?

111
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,260
What did you do to her?

112
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:17,980
Don't worry.

113
00:07:19,200 --> 00:07:20,780
She is in a very safe place.

114
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,820
As long as you cooperate with me,

115
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:24,460
I won't hurt her.

116
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:56,840
How can you two

117
00:07:57,620 --> 00:07:58,600
be together?

118
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,620
Running a shop on your own

119
00:08:01,620 --> 00:08:02,800
is indeed more free.

120
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,400
But

121
00:08:04,620 --> 00:08:06,380
it's good to have a powerful backer.

122
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,600
Mr. Chu can give me what I want.

123
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,220
Why wouldn't I cooperate with him?

124
00:08:11,180 --> 00:08:12,380
You two have been colluding for a long time.

125
00:08:18,900 --> 00:08:19,920
You know what?

126
00:08:20,460 --> 00:08:21,640
I hate

127
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:23,080
the way you

128
00:08:23,300 --> 00:08:24,940
pretend to be noble.

129
00:08:31,620 --> 00:08:32,660
Your words

130
00:08:32,660 --> 00:08:33,680
are really ridiculous.

131
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:37,380
Isn't it good to find a backer?

132
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,360
Pretending to be noble.

133
00:08:44,300 --> 00:08:45,340
I really made a mistake about you.

134
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,380
I thought you had come around

135
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:48,960
and wanted to rely on yourself,

136
00:08:49,180 --> 00:08:50,040
not on men.

137
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:51,720
You always

138
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,680
have a bad taste.

139
00:08:53,220 --> 00:08:54,660
If Young Master Chu

140
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:56,480
didn't want to deal with you personally,

141
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,700
you would have been killed

142
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:58,940
for being such a nuisance.

143
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:01,900
Now,

144
00:09:02,540 --> 00:09:03,980
he should be called General Governor Chu.

145
00:09:06,660 --> 00:09:07,560
I'll leave her to you.

146
00:09:08,780 --> 00:09:10,220
Don't forget what you promised me,

147
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:12,220
and the benefits you promised to Ye Family.

148
00:09:32,780 --> 00:09:33,540
What do you want to do?

149
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:34,520
Xiao Wan,

150
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,300
Let's get married.

151
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:37,980
Marry me,

152
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:39,540
and you'll be the wife of the military governor,

153
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,720
far more prestigious

154
00:09:41,980 --> 00:09:42,800
than the Young Marshal's wife.

155
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:44,420
Bastard!

156
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:46,180
Don't even think about it!

157
00:09:46,980 --> 00:09:48,380
Ling Shenxing won't let you get away with this.

158
00:09:48,780 --> 00:09:49,900
He will come to rescue me.

159
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,100
Ling Shenxing?

160
00:09:55,020 --> 00:09:56,600
is disgraced

161
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:59,040
and imprisoned,

162
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,860
awaiting execution

163
00:10:02,520 --> 00:10:03,980
at noon today.

164
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,440
Do you think

165
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,760
he'll come for you?

166
00:10:35,580 --> 00:10:36,280
Marry me,

167
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:39,740
and I'll keep him alive

168
00:10:41,460 --> 00:10:42,460
for one more day

169
00:10:42,460 --> 00:10:43,760
for each day you're with me.

170
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:45,820
How's that?

171
00:10:46,860 --> 00:10:47,720
Pretty good deal,

172
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,340
huh?
